an10.27:19.1 starts: (10) “When it was said: ‘A question about ten,
an10.27:19.2 starts: with reference to what was this said?
an10.27:19.3 starts: When a bhikkhu is completely disenchanted with ten things, completely dispassionate
an10.27:19.4 starts: What ten things?
